      "title": "Business Analyst - Retail Energy",
      "company_name": "Example Consulting",
      "first_published": "2026-09-20T10:00:00-04:00",
      "language": "en",
      "application_deadline": null,
      "content": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Join our Retail Energy practice as a Business Analyst.&amp;nbsp;You will gather requirements &amp;amp; model processes.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&amp;rsquo;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Run stakeholder workshops&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Write user stories&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&amp;rsquo;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&amp;rsquo;s degree in Business, Finance or Information Systems&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in business analysis&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL and Excel skills&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Must be authorized to work in the United States. We are unable to sponsor visas for this role.&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience with Power BI&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Energy industry exposure&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Work with business sponsors to scope analysis.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;script&gt;alert(&#x27;x&#x27;)&lt;/script&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#fff&quot;&gt;LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$85,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$105,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;",
